      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Kromoss T2I \u2014 turbo, then hires refine\n\nLeave **turbo** on. Pass 1 is 4 steps, CFG 1, `moss_image_sft_4_steps_lora_v2_600_avg_rank_72_bf16` at strength 1, euler / simple, shift 5, no skip-layer guidance. Do not merge the LoRA.\n\nPass 2 is the low half of that same schedule (split at step 2 of 4) at 1.5\u00d7 latent size. **MOSS Latent Upscale** (not stock Upscale Latent \u2014 that divides by 8). **MOSS Inject Noise** at strength 0 (exact leftover continuation \u2014 raise it only if upscale smoothing softens grain), then SamplerCustomAdvanced with **Disable Noise**. Do not swap pass 2 to Random Noise.\n\nTurn turbo off for 50 steps, CFG 3, no LoRA, SLG layer 22, split at step 30.\n\n### Blur\n\n- Kromoss, not Base. 1MP first pass (side \u2265 896), multiples of 16.\n- Latent stays **128ch /16**. `flux2-vae_small`.\n- No prompt upsampler. It rewrites layout JSON.\n- Pass 2 is a refine. The layout stays at the canvas size; the latent carries the composition.\n\n### Boxes\n\nEmpty canvas = plain T2I. Draw boxes and `moss_layout` is what gets encoded.\n\n### Models\n\n- `diffusion_models/kromoss_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `loras/moss/moss_image_sft_4_steps_lora_v2_600_avg_rank_72_bf16.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors` type `moss_image`\n- `vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors`\n\nBoth MOSS nodes ship in this pack."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
